30,2,1,talk,Rin,,"All-in rates are unfair for light eaters, and separate rooms last time had a huge price difference between us!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"The ferry is a time sink, taking two whole days. The train to the valley is much faster.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"Offshore houses are cheap per head, and renting a whole building makes the bill divide evenly.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Takumi,,The inn has strict mealtimes and we'd all be on futons in one room. The island houses have cold water and only one bath.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"Last year we barely saw each other, but in a shared house, there was absolutely no privacy for anyone.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, if a whole building divides evenly, that sounds much better than the separate room mess I found.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Takumi, if the island house is that bad, maybe we should avoid it, especially with the ferry times.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, exactly. A single bill for the building prevents the discrepancies we had last time.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Toshio, if the shared house was too crowded, maybe the inn's one-room setup is also a bad idea?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, it's a trade-off. One room is crowded, but separate city plans might mean we don't meet at all.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Rin,,"I just want a price that doesn't change! If we buy meals separately, I'm worried about the total.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'm leaning toward the train option. I can't deal with two days of travel again.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"The offshore house is the most logically fair for the budget, but the logistics might be the issue.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Takumi,,I can't do one bathroom for five people. That's a nightmare.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Toshio,,We need a balance. A town allows us to be together but also gives us space to breathe.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
