55,3,1,talk,Rin,,"Option A is a house, B is an inn, and C is the city. I hate the idea of separate bills in Option C!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Option A takes too long to get to. Option B is a quick train ride. I prefer B.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Option A is the most financially transparent. Option C is a disaster for fair splitting.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Takumi,,Option B has a strict schedule and one room. Option C gives me my own door and no timetable.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Option A is too crowded. Option C is too lonely. Option B seems like a middle ground.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, if we do Option B, is the all-in rate better or worse for the budget?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Takumi, is a strict schedule really worse than spending two days on a ferry?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, the inn rates are higher, but it's a fixed cost. Option C is the riskiest for our wallets.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, yes, it is. I can't stand being told when to eat and sleeping on a futon with everyone.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, but Option C might mean we spend the whole trip as strangers again.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Rin,,I'll vote for A because the bill is one simple division.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'm voting B. The travel time is the only thing that matters to me.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Asuka,,I'll vote A. It's the only way to ensure no one is out of pocket.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Takumi,,I'm voting C. I need my own space and a flexible schedule to actually enjoy the trip.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I'll vote B. It keeps us together without the claustrophobia of a single house.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
